::  name       brush parse error count
::  shape      errors - int (@u32)
::  invariant  .brush refuse suite names ten ParseError paths
::  example    10
::  readers    Brushstroke · Surface · refuse suite · .brush lower
::  nib        surface-p42-v0
::
::  Surface Season p42 — eighth pedestal in src/sur (structure museum).
::  Names the ParseError set in brushstroke/brush_parse.rye:
::  MissingAtNib · MissingPresent · PresentNotFrame · MissingMaxLines ·
::  MaxLinesOutOfBound · MissingLines · EmptyLine · TooManyLines ·
::  BadMaxLines · SourceTooLarge. Does not invent a Wayland window ·
::  skate/ graduation · or Realidream invent.
+$  brush-parse-error-count-shape
  $:  errors=@u32
  ==
